    "description": "",
    "content": "<p>退款单可以选择在线账户退款吗？\n答：扫码收银的销售单，不支持作废；退货也无法选择在线账户原返，只能线下给客户，比如微信转账。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202509/5ee3066c750fba5d5b626c18b99c98e8.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202509/d15ed82a7422cf109120c59f10aafa7d.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202509/99d959d088d46e07a959172498d1719c.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202509/cbc390afa6052d059096ba0c641f25f1.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
